WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,060 --> 00:00:07,540
We succeeded in naughty burning

2
00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:08,900
You can do it exactly as it is

3
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:10,860
It shows that all the brains have not been lost in the camp.

4
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:12,860
Xue Ya still thinks she is ugly

5
00:00:12,860 --> 00:00:14,900
Just ask her if she wants to use a container that can hold water.

6
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:15,820
Can make soup

7
00:00:15,820 --> 00:00:16,860
More valuable than appearance

8
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:18,300
Wait until survival becomes stable

9
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:19,420
Let’s talk about whether it looks good or not

10
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:22,060
If I go back, I will definitely send her to the desert island as she is.

11
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:23,500
Being usable is more important than looking good

12
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:27,050
She's looking more and more like the camp boss now

13
00:00:27,050 --> 00:00:28,010
That's your problem

14
00:00:28,010 --> 00:00:30,010
Don't expect me to resolve your internal conflicts for you.

15
00:00:30,010 --> 00:00:33,010
But you clearly know that Xue Ya uses your lighter to pressure people, so what?

16
00:00:33,010 --> 00:00:34,490
You want me to go back and do justice for you

17
00:00:34,490 --> 00:00:35,890
When you drove me away

18
00:00:35,890 --> 00:00:37,210
Each of you has a mouth

19
00:00:37,250 --> 00:00:38,290
There are also choices

20
00:00:38,290 --> 00:00:39,490
Now I want to change the rules

21
00:00:39,490 --> 00:00:42,380
Just fight for yourself, that is to say

22
00:00:42,380 --> 00:00:43,780
We can exchange resources from you

23
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:45,020
But I can’t treat you as my backer

24
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:46,180
Finally understood

25
00:00:46,180 --> 00:00:47,980
Aren't you afraid that she will really control everyone?

26
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:49,300
She really has that ability

27
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:51,300
You won’t complain about me every day.
